{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/x-HNL4JQXan8lkOwPWYojQ","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:57:27.893225+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/x-HNL4JQXan8lkOwPWYojQ","html":"<div><section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><span>为促进全国各高校之间优秀大学生的交流与沟通，增进优秀大学生对厦门大学信息学院的了解，激发优秀学子的科研兴趣，厦门大学信息学院拟举办</span><strong><span>“厦门大学信息学院（特色化示范性软件学院）2025年全国优秀大学生暑期夏令营活动”</span></strong><span>。</span><span><span>本年度夏令营采用</span></span><strong><span>线下进组实习实践</span></strong><span><span>的参营模式，实习实践时间在</span></span><strong><span>7月7日-7月11日</span></strong><span><span>之间，实习实践时长不少于3天，不超过5天。</span></span></p><p><strong><span>厦门市智能存储与计算重点实验室诚邀全国优秀大学生报名参加厦大信息学院夏令营活动，探索前沿科技，成就学术梦想，期待你的加入！</span></strong></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/QJxzAlGbYTMaDkM3Rl1ibkwJlhic6Mrl9UEWFFQoLaJiaoF3QVcyoqLXaaYiaNnVrWyomQNrAdGXPDObnU2aJd38zw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>团队介绍</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/QJxzAlGbYTMaDkM3Rl1ibkwJlhic6Mrl9UEWFFQoLaJiaoF3QVcyoqLXaaYiaNnVrWyomQNrAdGXPDObnU2aJd38zw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/5zT7OlSzLdXqMw9WdChgepU9wX9iceH36QibM1htoZ2WX1US9MDPRAAOLBcaQhyHrMwEf58dL9ym5KHEkDk63ib2A/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section><section><p><span><strong><span>舒继武 </span></strong></span><strong><span>教授</span></strong></p><p><strong><span><span>国家杰青、</span></span><span><span>国家级高层次人才、</span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span><span>I